msgid "cuda.tile.transpose"
msgstr "cuda.tile.transpose"

#: cuda.tile._stub.transpose:1 of
msgid "Transposes two axes of the input tile with at least 2 dimensions."
msgstr "转置至少包含 2 个维度的输入 Tile 中的两个轴。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.transpose:3 of
msgid ""
"For a 2-dimensional tile, the two axes are transposed if `axis0` and "
"`axis1` are not specified. For tiles with more than 2 dimensions, `axis0`"
" and `axis1` must be explicitly specified."
msgstr ""
"对于二维 Tile，若未指定 ``axis0`` 和 ``axis1`` ，则默认转置这两个轴。对于超过二维的 Tile，必须显式指定 "
"``axis0`` 和 ``axis1`` 。"

